    "text": "If $\\mathrm{A}=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{array}\\right]$ and $k \\mathrm{~A}=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}0 & 3 a \\\\ 2 b & 24\\end{array}\\right]$, then the values of $k, a$ and $b$ respectively are:",
